[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   Step 129: Frame-anchored bipolar unification test (step_b93).
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   Registered test of the single-field reading of the two-era transit
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   record, run entirely on the independent two-leg refit checkpoints
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   (step_b91 pre-2018, step_b92 post-2017) so that no Warsaw- or
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   JPL-lineage solution enters the observable.
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   The bipolar hypothesis: both eras' slip residuals are the same m=1
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   structure anchored on one axis, evaluated at opposite signed polarity
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   by era.  The CMB dipole apex is used as the externally declared frame
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   axis (the scalar-field rest frame already used in the GNSS, flyby and
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   lunar-ranging channels); no axis is selected from the data for the
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   registered tests.
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   T1  Per-era CMB-frame dipole of the kick-regressed log-rotation
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   residual (covariate model identical to step_125) on our own fits,
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   and identically on the catalogue channels carried in the same
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   checkpoints for a lineage cross-check.  Permutation nulls.
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   T2  Joint opposite-polarity statistic J = -b_pre * b_post (positive
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   when the two eras carry opposite-signed CMB dipoles).  Null: the
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   residual labels are permuted within each era and J recomputed;
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   p_J is the fraction of draws reaching J_obs.  One-sided era
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   p-values are Fisher-combined as a second joint measure.
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   T3  Direction shuffle: J(u) evaluated on 500 random bipolar axes --
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   the extremeness of the CMB axis among arbitrary axes on the
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   independent record.
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   T4  Bipolar-cap audit: 60-deg caps about the CMB apex and antapex;
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   per era the residual, per-leg deviations and leg-disagreement are
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   contrasted apex-cap vs antapex-cap (characterization of which
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   lobe and which leg carries each era's structure).
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   T5  Controls: post-2017 NG-clean subset, n_obs median strata, and
[2026-09-20 12:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 129]   the pre-2018 CODE-overlap carrier subset.
